    "schedstat.runqueue_distribution": {
      "title": "Runqueue Distribution",
      "body": "What is this?\nA grouped article for runqueue depth and scheduling pressure statistics.\n\nWhy it matters\nA large runqueue distribution means tasks are ready to run, but CPU time is not keeping up.\n\nHow to read\n- count: sample volume\n- max: worst queue depth\n- buckets: whether contention is brief or constant\n"
    },
