    "vmstat.page_reclaim_distribution": {
      "title": "Page Reclaim Distribution",
      "body": "What is this?\nA grouped article for reclaim activity, especially when the kernel starts reclaiming aggressively.\n\nWhy it matters\nThe shape of reclaim activity tells you whether memory pressure is manageable or spiraling.\n\nHow to read\n- count: sample count\n- max: worst reclaim burst\n- buckets: whether reclaim is smooth or sawtooth\n"
    },
